      "summaries": {
        "en": "Register is an open-source service that provides free '.is-a.dev' subdomains for developers, solving the need for memorable web addresses without domain registration costs. It operates through automated DNS configuration on Cloudflare, enabling instant subdomain activation via GitHub pull requests. Developers can use it to host personal portfolios, project demos, or documentation sites, integrating seamlessly with GitHub Pages for straightforward static web hosting.",
        "zh": "Register 是一个开源项目，为开发者提供免费的 '.is-a.dev' 子域名服务，解决了获取易记网络地址而无需支付域名注册费用的问题。它通过 Cloudflare 的自动化 DNS 配置实现，开发者只需提交 GitHub 拉取请求即可即时激活子域名。该项目适用于托管个人作品集、项目演示或文档网站，并能与 GitHub Pages 无缝集成，便于快速部署静态网页，让开发者轻松建立专业在线形象。",
        "es": "Register is an open-source service that provides free '.is-a.dev' subdomains for developers, solving the need for memorable web addresses without domain registration costs. It operates through automated DNS configuration on Cloudflare, enabling instant subdomain activation via GitHub pull requests. Developers can use it to host personal portfolios, project demos, or documentation sites, integrating seamlessly with GitHub Pages for straightforward static web hosting.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "register stands out for cloudflare, dev, and developer in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "Register is an open-source service that provides free '.is-a.dev' subdomains for developers, solving the need for memorable web addresses without domain registration costs. It operates through automated DNS configuration on Cloudflare, enabling instant subdomain activation via GitHub pull requests. Developers can use it to host personal portfolios, project demos, or documentation sites, integrating seamlessly with GitHub Pages for straightforward static web hosting.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/is-a-dev/register for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
