      "summaries": {
        "en": "Impeccable is a JavaScript design language system that helps AI applications generate more consistent and aesthetically pleasing visual outputs, addressing the common challenge of AI-generated designs appearing disjointed or inconsistent. Its technical innovation lies in providing structured design tokens, constraints, and patterns that guide AI models to produce coherent visual elements while maintaining creative flexibility. Developers can integrate it into their AI design tools through its JavaScript API, experiment with custom design rules, or use it to create more polished UI components, prototypes, and branding materials with AI assistance.",
        "zh": "Impeccable 是一个 JavaScript 设计语言系统，旨在解决 AI 生成设计时常见的视觉不一致问题，帮助 AI 应用输出更协调美观的界面。它通过提供结构化的设计标记、约束和模式，引导 AI 模型在保持创意灵活性的同时，生成风格统一的视觉元素。开发者可通过其 JavaScript API 集成到 AI 设计工具中，自定义设计规则，或用于创建更精致的 UI 组件、原型和品牌材料，让 AI 辅助的设计工作更加高效可靠。",
        "es": "Impeccable is a JavaScript design language system that helps AI applications generate more consistent and aesthetically pleasing visual outputs, addressing the common challenge of AI-generated designs appearing disjointed or inconsistent. Its technical innovation lies in providing structured design tokens, constraints, and patterns that guide AI models to produce coherent visual elements while maintaining creative flexibility. Developers can integrate it into their AI design tools through its JavaScript API, experiment with custom design rules, or use it to create more polished UI components, prototypes, and branding materials with AI assistance.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "impeccable gives teams a dependable path to production-ready AI tooling.",
          "what": "Impeccable is a JavaScript design language system that helps AI applications generate more consistent and aesthetically pleasing visual outputs, addressing the common challenge of AI-generated designs appearing disjointed or inconsistent. Its technical innovation lies in providing structured design tokens, constraints, and patterns that guide AI models to produce coherent visual elements while maintaining creative flexibility. Developers can integrate it into their AI design tools through its JavaScript API, experiment with custom design rules, or use it to create more polished UI components, prototypes, and branding materials with AI assistance.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/pbakaus/impeccable for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
